# The Gobbiebag Part I (jeuno 27): the 43 finish begins it on option 0 only (option == 0): option -1 (0xFFFFFFFF) does
# not. A fresh char (fame level 1, the inventory 30): 43 (31, 0, 1), option -1: nothing; 43 again, option 0: begun;
# accepted: 43 (31, 1, 1).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # available: 43 (31, 0, 1)
finish option=-1                        # not 0: nothing
trigger Bluffnix                        # still available: 43 (31, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted: 43 (31, 1, 1)
finish
